//! Turn long, repetitive `#[cfg(...)]` predicates into readable,
//! self-documenting code.
//!
//! # Approach
//!
//! 1. **Semantic aliases.** `build.rs` maps raw target predicates
//!    (`target_family = "unix"`, `target_pointer_width = "64"`, ...) onto the
//!    aliases declared here (`platform_unix`, `pointer_64`, ...). Long
