//!    call site.
//! 2. **One dispatch point.** Mutually exclusive implementations live in
//!    [`sys`], which selects exactly one module with [`cfg_if!`].
//! 3. **Attributes for items, `cfg_if!` for blocks.** `#[cfg]` guards items,
//!    fields and match arms; `cfg_if!` guards statements and imports, where an
//!    attribute cannot be attached.
//!
